  (201706250, 'D', 'Environmental protection is not much of a concern when Britons buy toilet paper.', 'https://www.guojiya.cn/exam/cet4_2017_06_3/answers', 0.9700, '公开答案页；按题干与选项文本映射，未依赖网页套号或选项顺序'),
